1. PURPOSE

The VRP Validation Kit, including its source code, validation software,
scenarios, documentation, reports, evidence formats, schemas, diagrams,
test logic, verification logic, and associated repository materials
(collectively, the "Validation Kit"), is made available solely for:

- independent evaluation;
- technical validation;
- testing;
- security review;
- academic or engineering research;
- reproduction of published validation experiments;
- verification of publicly stated VRP validation claims.

The Validation Kit exists to evaluate selected externally observable
properties of VRP and related validation subjects.

The Validation Kit is NOT the production implementation of VRP.

Publication of the Validation Kit does not place VRP, its protected
implementation, or any associated intellectual property into the public
domain.


2. LIMITED EVALUATION LICENSE

Subject to full compliance with this License, Vitalijus Riabovas grants you
a limited, revocable, non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable
license to use the Validation Kit solely for non-production evaluation and
verification.

Under this limited permission, you may:

- view this repository;
- clone this repository for your own evaluation;
- inspect source code contained specifically within the Validation Kit;
- compile and execute the Validation Kit;
- execute supplied public validation scenarios;
- create temporary local modifications necessary for evaluation;
- perform independent technical and security testing;
- reproduce published validation experiments;
- analyze generated validation evidence;
- compare validation results;
- develop additional evaluation scenarios for your own testing;
- report bugs and reproducible counterexamples;
- publish truthful evaluation results in accordance with Section 8.

No permission is granted beyond these evaluation purposes.


