6. PROTECTED IMPLEMENTATION BOUNDARY

The Validation Kit is intentionally separated from the protected VRP runtime.

Nothing in this License grants access or rights to:

- protected VRP runtime source code;
- non-public authority implementation;
- non-public continuity-engine implementation;
- non-public recovery implementation;
- private cryptographic material;
- private keys;
- credentials;
- protected runtime memory;
- proprietary deployment material;
- confidential implementation documentation.

The ability to observe, test, or validate externally visible behavior does
not create a right to obtain or reproduce protected implementation material.


